<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Oh, what a fact! Oh, what a bliss!</l><l>That I of Christ a member am.</l><l>With all the saints I blend as one</l><l>And share the life of the new man.</l><l>Joined to our great ascended Head,</l><l>We’ll be the Church of His own plan.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
